      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As someone with relatively slow internet I do love this idea. On the flip side I feel like this would really push players to make nearly empty worlds and create a negative stereotype against <10mb worlds. I personally think having the opposite, a 50, 100, or 200mb world or greater category would be more useful.",
